{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3450","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3450","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3450\",\"parent_revision\":\"1df22be1386e642983ea476def1f03cdad064311c6214256a9f0d1c8e363322e\",\"root_revision\":\"1df22be1386e642983ea476def1f03cdad064311c6214256a9f0d1c8e363322e\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n`.claude/agents/backlog-mcp-validator.md` was an experiment for validating the backlog FastMCP server and is not maintained (repo owner, 2026-09-06). Its `tools:` frontmatter grants only the ten `mcp__plugin_dh_backlog__backlog_*` tools and spawns only the backlog server, so it cannot exercise `sam_plan`, `sam_task` or `sam_active_task`; a plan draft in this session assigned it that job before reading its grant. Either delete it or rewrite it as a `sam` validator whose frontmatter lists the `sam_*` tools and spawns `scripts/run_sam_server.py`. The supported validation path today is the `fastmcp` client per `docs/mcp-server-validation.md` and the CLI-versus-server pattern in `plugins/development-harness/tests/test_frontend_parity.py`.\\n\\nSecond gap found the same way: `plugins/development-harness/AGENTS.md` names `dh_core/operations.py` as the shared layer both frontends import (line 427-428) but never states how the Typer CLI is invoked. The invocation (`uv run \\\"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/sam_schema/cli.py\\\" <group> <command>`, a PEP 723 script, with `scripts/run_sam_cli.py` as the wrapper) lives only inside skill bodies and the repo-level `rules/script-invocation.md`. One sentence beside the `dh_core` line closes it; the work-ledger plan lists it under its documentation slice, but it is independent and can land first.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Design session 0123saEQFTYnFb79CLozrH7i, 2026-09-06\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-09-06\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"689255010697a23fedab19988b8f6a40145b83810590c2217eef3ff7a5d0348b\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABUIyj5g\"}"}